  "selfReview": "The coda as a sting. Critic round 1 (2026-11-24): it now starts with two video frames (66.7 ms) of digital silence before the downbeat; the sync point is in the metadata (`downbeatSec` 0.0667, `downbeatFrame30` 2), so a placement a frame early no longer clips the attack. The landing is carried by piano (4.7 dB under the mix), cymbal and snare; the kick sits 12.7 dB under (5.5 before). Badger is 0.3 dB under the motif on full range and 0.8 dB on the phone model (3.9 and 5.0 before). Critic round 2 (2026-11-24): Limiter 1.70 dB max, over 1 dB 1.4 % of the time; Badger -1.2 dB against the motif (phone model -2.9 dB). Piano D2 +0.4 c on the SHOW hit (-17.2), celli pizzicato -1.6 c median (n 2, 0 beyond 10 c) (+8 to +12). -1.3 dBTP after AAC 128k (worst of ten).",
